.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_FILES 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_files \- return the number of valid files in an MPQ archive.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__archive_files("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "files"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__archive_files\fP() to get the number of valid files in the
archive. Deleted or free hash entries are excluded.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function stores the number of valid files
in \fIfiles\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__file_blocks (3)
